The '''Storage''' is a section in the [[SkyBlock Menu]] and acts as a shortcut to the {{Item|Ender Chest}}, as well as a way to store and open [[Backpack]]s.

== Interface ==
{{/UI}}

== Usage ==
Clicking on the Storage icon in the {{Item|SkyBlock Menu}}. will open the menu. Once inside, it will reveal the [[player]]'s {{Item|Ender Chest}} slots on the top, and a storage area for [[Backpack]]s below.

There are 18 [[Backpack]] slots in total, however only slot #1 is unlocked by default. Slots 2-18 are unlocked through exchanging {{Item|Fairy Soul}}s at {{NPCSprite|Tia the Fairy}}.

[[Backpack]]s cannot be removed from the Storage if they contain items. The Storage is also the only current way to open [[Backpack]]s. 

You can unlock extra [[Ender Chest]] slots with {{Gems}}.

== Trivia ==
* On the time of its release, the third [[Ender Chest]] section was removed, effectively deleting all items contained within it. It is not known if these items will be returned in any way.
* The storage can be quickly accessed with the command <code>/storage</code> or <code>/st</code>
* Backpacks that were stored in slots 2-18 before they were locked remained, it was only slots that were empty that were locked.

